          "text": "{\"answer_text\":\"I cannot determine which disease concepts the PSEN1 evidence records are mapped to because no graph records or mapping information were supplied. I also cannot determine whether any mappings are missing or why. Although PSEN1 is commonly associated with familial early-onset Alzheimer disease, that general knowledge does not establish how these particular records are mapped. This is an unverified development-control response, not clinical advice.\",\"claims\":[],\"unanswered\":[\"Which disease concepts are assigned to each PSEN1 evidence record in the graph?\",\"Are any records missing a disease-concept mapping, and if so, what is the documented reason?\"]}"
